        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Clean Up a Rough Voice Recording\n\nRepairs a voice recording made in an ordinary room. Every step is local signal processing with no model.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Recording\" takes the audio. \"2 Gate\" silences noise below -48 dB, \"3 Cut rumble\" removes everything under 90 Hz, \"4 Even it out\" compresses at a 3:1 ratio, and \"5 Limit\" caps peaks at -1 dB. \"6 Cleaned\" plays the result.\n\n**Try this:** If quiet words get cut off, lower threshold_db on \"2 Gate\" to -55."
        },
        "ui_properties": {
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "zIndex": 0,
          "width": 560,
          "selectable": true,
          "height": 247
        },
